              "oldText": "Commerce One warrants that during the Warranty Period the Software and MarketSite.net Service is free of any willfully introduced computer virus",
              "newText": "Commerce One warrants that at all times during the term of this Agreement the Software and MarketSite.net Service is free of any computer virus"
            },
