              "paragraphId": "p0082",
              "numbering": "7.5",
              "text": "Services Warranty. Commerce One warrants that all installation, implementation, support, training and other professional services provided under this Agreement will be performed in a professional and workmanlike manner consistent with industry standards. Corio's remedy for breach of this warranty is, at Commerce One's option, prompt re-performance of the non-conforming services or a refund of the fees paid for such non-conforming services."
